{"strongs": "H3760", "word": "כַּרְמֶל", "translit": "kar.mel", "root": "כרמל", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a mountain and city", "gloss": "Carmel", "definition": "II. כַּרְמֶל proper name, of a mountain and city Carmel : — 1. mountain-promontory on Mediterranean, with fertile slopes, Tel el-Amarna ( Ginti- ) Kirmil , Jastr JBL xi. 1892, 115 ; Josh 19:26 , ׳ הַרהַֿכּ 1Kgs 18:19 ; 1Kgs 18:20 ; 2Kgs 2:25 ; 2Kgs 4:25 ׳ ראֹשׁ הַכּ Amos 1:2 ; Amos 9:3 ; 1Kgs 18:42 with article also Josh 12:22 and, + בָּשָׁן , Jer 50:19 , as pasturage (in figurative of Israel as flock of ׳ י ), compare ( ׳ כ without article) Mic 7:14 (less probably rend. garden-land , I. כַּרְמִל , so We GASm ); ׳ הַכּ Isa 35:2 ( + הַלְּבָּנוֺן הַשָּׁרוֺן ) ׳ כ Isa 33:9 (+ לְבָנוֺן הַשָּׁרוֺן and בָּשָׁן , marking extent of land), Nah 1:4 (+ לְבָנוֺן בָּשָׁן ); כְּכַרְמֶל בַּיָּם Jer 46:18 (simile of Nebuchadnezzar); Song 7:6 ׳ ראֹשֵׁךְ עָלַיִךְ כַּכּ (but see כַּרְמִיל ); — on Carmel see GASm G. 337 ff. Buhl G. 23. 2. city, 3 h. south of Hebron, כַּרְמֶל Josh 15:55 ׳ בַּכּ 1Sam 25:2 (twice in verse); 1Sam 25:7 כַּרְמֶ֫לָה v 1Sam 25:5 (= to Carmel ); הַכַּרְמֶ֫לָה 1Sam 15:12 ; 1Sam 25:40 . — Modern Kurmul , Rob BR i. 492-498, ii. 97 Buhl G. 163 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4201')\">BDB4201</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3760')\">H3760</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4200')\">BDB4200</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4202')\">BDB4202</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>כַּרְמֶל</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a mountain and city</b> <highlightword>Carmel</highlightword>: — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> mountain-promontory on Mediterranean, with fertile slopes, Tel el-Amarna (<highlight>Ginti-</highlight>) <highlight>Kirmil</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Jastr')\">Jastr<sup>JBL xi. 1892, 115</sup></lookup>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:26\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,26)\">